silm:instances_papers_11_base_commutative_diagram_chapters_26_circuit_imprint_tensor_sections_03_tensor_construction_concrete_anchor_3#domaincontexts_apex silm:hasLongDescription "The DomainContexts_apex is the colimit-apex domain-contexts category: the union over all corners of (substrate, scope, layer) instantiation contexts. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'DomainContexts_apex', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
